setWhitelistedSource.t.sol
└── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when whitelisting a source (isWhitelisted = true)
    │   ├── when source is not currently whitelisted
    │   │   └── it should whitelist the source and emit WhitelistStatusUpdated
    │   └── when source is already whitelisted
    │       └── it should keep the source whitelisted and emit WhitelistStatusUpdated
    └── when removing a source from whitelist (isWhitelisted = false)
        ├── when source is currently whitelisted
        │   └── it should remove the source from whitelist and emit WhitelistStatusUpdated
        └── when source is not currently whitelisted
            └── it should keep the source not whitelisted and emit WhitelistStatusUpdated